<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head runat="server"><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><title>Guardian Health — Help and access</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../Content/guardian.css?v=20261008.r2" /><link rel="stylesheet" href="../Content/guardian-auth.css?v=20261008.r2" /></head><body class="gh-auth-simple"><main class="gh-auth-card"><p class="gh-eyebrow">GUARDIAN HEALTH HOSPITAL</p><h1>How can we help?</h1><p>Practical help with your Guardian Health account.</p><form id="form1" runat="server"><details class="gh-panel"><summary>Signing in for the first time</summary><p>Use the email, password and role provided by reception or your hospital administrator. Contact reception if your patient account is not linked to your record.</p></details><details class="gh-panel"><summary>Forgotten password</summary><p>Use <a href="ForgotPassword.aspx">password recovery</a> to request a reset. A reset link expires and can only be used once. Never share it with another person.</p></details><details class="gh-panel"><summary>Appointments and records</summary><p>Sign in to the patient portal to book a published appointment slot, request rescheduling, or view your records. Reception confirms changes to requested times.</p></details><details class="gh-panel"><summary>Results and messages</summary><p>Completed laboratory results and hospital notifications appear in your portal. Contact your care team for an explanation of your results.</p></details><p><a href="ContactAdmin.aspx">Request account assistance</a></p><p><a href="Support.aspx">Report a technical issue</a></p><p>Do not use this website for emergency assistance.</p></form><nav class="gh-help-links" aria-label="Help navigation"><a href="login.aspx">Sign in</a><a href="HelpCenter.aspx">Help centre</a><a href="Guest/Home.aspx">Hospital home</a></nav></main><script src="../Scripts/guardian.js?v=20261008.r2" defer></script></body></html>
